+	/** Round 101: detect the late finish-pocket denial class recorded at
+	 * Hairpin seed 68. The normal score-shaped, scorer-shaped, and true-rival
+	 * worlds all let the chosen line cross because the real leader itself
+	 * yields to preserve first place, brakes, and seals the sole exit. In the
+	 * final eight map turns, run one bounded full-fidelity world for each legal
+	 * candidate. If the scorer's choice dies there, prefer a surviving move by
+	 * actual finish round, then survivor margin and map TTF. Ambiguity keeps the
+	 * champion line; the downstream danger pass remains an independent veto. */
+	private Direction finishDenialBrakingOverride(final int[] pos, final int[] vel,
+			final int playerNum, final Direction chosen, final double[] trapByDir,
+			final int[] turnsByDir) {
+		if (inScorerSim || inTrueRivalConfirm || chosen == Direction.NONE
+				|| !kindHomogeneousRoster(playerNum)
